OL,3,AColombian ex-foreign minister charged
OL,4,Aover nanny's lie detector test
OL,5,
OL,6,FProsecutors in Colombia have accused
OL,7,Fformer foreign minister Laura Sarabia
OL,8,Fof abusing her power after she made her
OL,9,Fnanny take a lie detector test.
OL,11,FThe scandal erupted in 2023, when
OL,12,FColombian news weekly Semana reported
OL,13,Fthat a woman Sarabia had employed to
OL,14,Flook after her son had been hooked up
OL,15,Fto a polygraph and questioned over the
OL,16,Falleged disappearance of a case full of
OL,17,Fcash from Sarabia's flat.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,318,300,200,140,0,100
