OL,3,AColombian ex-foreign minister charged
OL,4,Aover nanny's lie detector test
OL,5,
OL,6,FSarabia, who was the chief of staff for
OL,7,FPresident Gustavo Petro at the time,
OL,8,Fresigned in June 2023 but was later
OL,9,Fappointed as foreign minister and,
OL,10,Ffollowing her resignation from that
OL,11,Fpost, as Colombia's ambassador to the
OL,12,FUnited Kingdom.
OL,14,FShe has denied any wrongdoing.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
